From: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] dt-bindings: npu: Add RK3568 to rknn-core binding

Extend the Rockchip RKNN core binding to cover the RK3568 NPU:

  - Add "rockchip,rk3568-rknn-core" to the compatible enum.

  - Document the "rockchip,pmu" property, which is required on RK3568.
    The RK3568 NPU NOC bus must be explicitly de-idled via PMU registers
    before the hardware can be accessed; the Rocket driver reads the PMU
    syscon handle from this property to perform that sequence.

  - Make "sram-supply" optional.  On RK3568 there is only a single NPU
    power rail (vdd_npu), so the same regulator covers both the core and
    SRAM.  Boards can still supply it (pointing to the same regulator as
    "npu-supply") to keep the binding consistent.

Signed-off-by: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
---
 .../bindings/npu/rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core.yaml         | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/npu/rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/npu/rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core.yaml
index XXXXXXX..XXXXXXX 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/npu/rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/npu/rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ description:
   compatible:
     enum:
+      - rockchip,rk3568-rknn-core
       - rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core
 
   reg:
@@ -52,6 +53,12 @@ properties:
   npu-supply: true
 
+  rockchip,pmu:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description:
+      Phandle to the Rockchip PMU syscon node.  Required on RK3568 to
+      perform the NPU NOC bus de-idle sequence via PMU registers before
+      the hardware can be accessed.
+
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
@@ -66,14 +73,14 @@ properties:
   sram-supply: true
 
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
   - reg-names
   - clocks
   - clock-names
   - interrupts
   - iommus
   - power-domains
   - resets
   - reset-names
   - npu-supply
-  - sram-supply
